    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.549999999999958,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        133.6172505470106,
        499.950000004375,
        348.06469002695411,
        11.549999999999958
      ],
      "text" : "of Winkler is similar to the classic algorithm of Burkard and Derigs (see e.g.,",
      "wraps" : true
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 9.9000000000000519,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        135.26684627543972,
        488.40000000245044,
        346.41509433962261,
        9.9000000000000519
      ],
      "text" : "[ 16]) in that it uses Dijkstra's shortest augmenting path for many computations",
