    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.549999999999958,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        133.6172505836017,
        318.45000000302355,
        344.76549865229111,
        11.549999999999958
      ],
      "text" : "been used in [ 10], [ 14], and [ 5]. Domingo-Ferrer et al [ 5] also used distance-",
